<Page title="Privacy" description="CricScience has no accounts and no tracking. Your progress is stored only in your own browser." lede="No accounts, no advertising and no tracking cookies.">
  <h2>What is stored</h2>
  <p>Your lesson progress, quiz answers, review schedule and daily streak are saved in your browser's local storage on your device. They are never sent to CricScience or anyone else. You can clear them at any time from the <a href="/progress">Progress page</a> or by clearing your browser's site data.</p>
  <h2>What is not collected</h2>
  <p>CricScience does not ask for your name or email, does not use advertising or tracking cookies, and does not sell or share data.</p>
  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>Like any website, the server that delivers these pages may keep standard technical logs (such as IP addresses and request times) for security and reliability. These are handled by the hosting provider and are not used to identify you.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about privacy: <a href="mailto:hello@cricscience.com">hello@cricscience.com</a>.</p>
  <p class="muted">Last updated 26 October 2026.</p>
</Page>
